9. Read vs Write workload

                  Now ask:                  
                              What type of traffic dominates e-commerce?
                  
                  Usually:     Product browsing/search
                                      ↓
                                     READS

                  far exceeds:                  
                              Order creation
                              Cart modification
                              Inventory update
                                      ↓
                                    WRITES

                  So our system is broadly:
                  
                                              E-COMMERCE
                                                   |
                                        ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                                        ↓                     ↓
                                      READS                 WRITES
                                        |                     |
                                 Product/Search          Cart/Order
                                 Catalog                 Inventory
                              
       This immediately tells us something important:
                                                      We should optimize the read path independently.      
      That will lead us toward:      
                                    CDN
                                     ↓
                                    Cache
                                     ↓
                                    Search index
                                     ↓
                                    Read replicas
      
      But we haven't chosen those yet.

We derive them from the requirements.
